OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor expelled for far-right
OL,4,Aparty membership
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has been expelled by the
OL,7,FReform UK party shortly after
OL,8,Fapologising for a series of social
OL,9,Fmedia posts in which he made offensive
OL,10,Fcomments about Muslims.
OL,12,FNewcastle City councillor Daniel Astley
OL,13,Fmade the derogatory references,
OL,14,Fincluding calling for what he regarded
OL,15,Fas "non-Europeans" to leave the UK,
OL,16,Flast year on a now deleted X account.
OL,18,FHe since said he wanted to "retract all
OL,19,Fprevious social media comments".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
