OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor expelled for far-right
OL,4,Aparty membership
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Newcastle Reform UK spokesperson
OL,7,Fearlier rejected criticism of Astley's
OL,8,Fcomments as "politically motivated
OL,9,Fnonsense", but the party's local leader
OL,10,FSteven Rutherford later announced
OL,11,FAstley had been expelled because of his
OL,12,Fprior membership of the far-right
OL,13,FHomeland Party.
